  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nPrincipal (P) = ₹60,000\n\nRate (r) = 15% per annum\n\nTime (t) = 4 years\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nA = P × (1 + r/100)t\n\n**Calculations:**\n\nA = 60000 × (1.15)⁴\n\n⇒ (1.15)² = 1.3225\n\n⇒ (1.15)³ = 1.520875\n\n⇒ (1.15)⁴ = 1.74900625\n\n⇒ A = 60000 × 1.74900625\n\n⇒ A = ₹104940.375 ≈ ₹1,04,940.38\n\n**∴ Total amount =​ ₹1,04,940.38 .**",
